This page gives detailed information on the Lua API provided by NCO for scripting.

How to read this document:

  - Global Objects can be used directly in your scripts
  - `Types` describe data contained as a field in global objects or returned by global objects functions
  - `Classes` are something you can import into your script and use: e.x. `local class = require("nco.Class")`

